        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^2+2x-1$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(2x+3)(x-1)-(x-2)(x+1)&=2x^2-2x+3x-3-(x^2+x-2x-2)\\\\(2x+3)(x-1)-(x-2)(x+1)&=2x^2+x-3-(x^2-x-2)\\\\(2x+3)(x-1)-(x-2)(x+1)&=2x^2+x-3-x^2+x+2\\\\(2x+3)(x-1)-(x-2)(x+1)&=x^2+2x-1\\end{align*}$$",
